  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6902.01 Compliance With State Fire Code. All persons using pyrotechnic effects, special effects, or flame effects in the performing arts in conjunction with theatrical, musical, or any similar productions before a proximate audience, performers, or support personnel shall comply with the requirements of the state fire code.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6900) #10067, eff 12-29-11, EXPIRED: 12-29-21\n\nNew. #13426, eff 8-3-22",
